# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# EmailJS configuration for the contact form.
# 1. Create a free account at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Add an email service and a template (template variables used:
#    from_name, reply_to, message, to_name).
# 3. Copy the values below into a file named ".env" in the project root.
#
# If these are left empty, the contact form falls back to opening the
# visitor's mail client with the message pre-filled.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
